    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108735" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπολύριος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύρα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>under the lyre,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόναξ ὑ.</span> a <i>cross reed to
			which</i> (in early lyres) <i>the lower ends of the strings were
